  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -12.6pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 27.3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그림은 염화 나트륨 수용액과 질산 은 수용액의 반응에서 질량 변화를 알아보는 실험을 나타낸 것이다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 4.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 14.7pt; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\"  coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\"  filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\t\t<v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\t\t<v:formulas>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\t\t</v:formulas>\t\t<v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\t\t<o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\t</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"_x236344344\" style=\"v-text-anchor:top;width:217.23pt;height:104.01pt;\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"><v:imagedata o:title=\"DRW000053b80277\" src=\"file:///C:\\Users\\user\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\DRW000053b80277.gif\"/></v:shape><![endif]-->&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 4.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 14.7pt; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999A21495EB354C42F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"290\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"290\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"앙금 생성 반응에서의 길량 변화.jpg\"  id=\"A_999A21495EB354C42FE64B\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 4.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 14.7pt; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><!--[if !vml]--><!--[endif]-->&nbsp; </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 14.7pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -15pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 44pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">① </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">두 수용액을 섞으면 물리 변화가 일어난다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -15pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 44pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">② </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">흰색 앙금인 질산 나트륨이 생성된다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -15pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 44pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">③ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">생성된 앙금의 양만큼 질량이 증가한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -15pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; margin-left: 44pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">④ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">질량은 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">가</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">와 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">나</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">가 같다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -15pt; margin-left: 44pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">⑤ </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">나</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">의 반응 직후 시험관을 막아 두면 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">에서 질량이 증가한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -15pt; margin-left: 44pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -15pt; margin-left: 44pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">이 문제에 정답이 4번이라 나와있는데요.&nbsp; (나)는 시험관에 두 수용액을 섞는 과정이고 하나의 시험관은 저울위에 있지 않아요, 그럼 질량이 같지 않나요?&nbsp; 아이들이 혼란이 오는 문제가 아닐까해 질문드립니다.</span></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
